  "description": "<p><strong>Scenario:</strong> An unusually potent protective ward requires both the character's reaction and a level 2+ spell slot. It adds +3 AC when an enemy's attack would hit the reactor. This demonstrates combining count and countAlt.</p><p><strong>Setup:</strong> Drag this Active Effect onto the actor who should own the External Reaction option. All changes use Override mode. If an option has a count requirement, that resource is spent when the option is accepted, according to External Reaction's count handling.</p>",
